{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T16:55:13+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-29T16:55:13+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"FinecoBank Banca Fineco S.p.A.","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Banks - Regional","country":"Italy","city":"Reggio Emilia","website":"https://it.finecobank.com","employees":1340,"summary":"FinecoBank Banca Fineco S.p.A. provides banking, credit, trading and investment services in Italy. It offers banking services, including current account services, payment services, mortgages, overdrafts, and personal loans, as well as debit, credit, and prepaid cards; and brokerage services comprising order execution services on behalf of customers with direct access to global equity markets, as well as trading of CFDs, futures, options, bonds, ETFs, and certificates. The company also provides asset management services, such as placement and distribution services of various products, including UCITS and SICAV units, and insurance and pension products, as well as investment advisory services. In addition, it operates financial shops. The company serves through a network of personal financial advisors, and online and mobile channels. FinecoBank Banca Fineco S.p.A. was founded in 1999 and is headquartered in Reggio Emilia, Italy.","exchange":"Milan","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Fineco Banca Fineco S.p.A. fournit des services bancaires, de crédit, de trading et d'investissement en Italie. Il offre des services bancaires, y compris des services de compte courant, des services de paiement, des prêts hypothécaires, des découverts et des prêts personnels, ainsi que des cartes de débit, de crédit et prépayées; et des services de courtage comprenant des services d'exécution d'ordres pour le compte de clients ayant un accès direct aux marchés boursiers mondiaux, ainsi que la négociation de CFD, de contrats à terme, d'options, d'o